{"strongs": "H5000", "word": "נָאוֶה", "translit": "na.eh", "root": "מתן", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "comely, seemly", "definition": "נָאוֶה adjective comely, seemly ; — ׳ נ masculine Song 2:14 + 3 t.; feminine נָאוָה Ps 33:1 + 4 t., נָוָה Jer 6:2 — 1. comely, beautiful , of woman Song 1:5 ; Song 6:4 (|| יָפָה ) of face Song 2:14 ( מַרְאֶה ) so נָוָה Jer 6:2 (figurative of Jerusalem; || מְעֻנָּגָה ); of mouth Song 4:3 (|| שְׂפָתוֺת ). 2. seemly , of praise תְּהִלָּה Ps 33:1 ; Ps 147:1 subject שְׂפַתיֶֿתֶר Prov 17:7 (compare Song 4:3 ); תַּעֲנוּג Song 19:10 כָּבוֺד Song 26:1 . So also Ps 93:5 Masora (anomalous feminine) see [ נאה ] above נְאוֺת see II. [ נָוָה ] below II. נוה .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4913')\">BDB4913</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5000')\">H5000</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4912')\">BDB4912</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4914')\">BDB4914</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נָאוֶה</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>comely, seemly</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> masculine <ref ref=\"Song 2:14\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(22,2,14)\">Song 2:14</ref> + 3 t.; feminine <bdbheb>נָאוָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 33:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,33,1)\">Ps 33:1</ref> + 4 t., <bdbheb>נָוָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 6:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,6,2)\">Jer 6:2</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>comely, beautiful</highlight>, of woman <ref ref=\"Song 1:5\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(22,1,5)\">Song 1:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 6:4\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(22,6,4)\">Song 6:4</ref> (|| <bdbheb>יָפָה</bdbheb>) of face <ref ref=\"Song 2:14\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" o